<LegalLayout title="Support" lastUpdated="September 9, 2026">
  <p>
    Something broken, a number that looks wrong, or a question about your
    account? Email us and a person will read it.
  </p>

  <p class="contact">
    <a href="mailto:dheeraj@supercoollabs.com">dheeraj@supercoollabs.com</a>
  </p>

  <p>
    It helps if you tell us the email address on your account and what you were
    doing when the problem happened.
  </p>

  <h2>Deleting your account</h2>
  <p>
    You can delete your account and everything in it from inside the app, under
    Settings, then Delete account. It removes your connected accounts, your
    transactions, and your profile. You do not need to email us to do it.
  </p>

  <h2>Other pages</h2>
  <p>
    Our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> covers what we collect and how we
    handle it, and our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> cover using the app.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>

<style>
  .contact {
    font-size: 18px;
